0 FILE roof-slope-row.ldr
0 Row of 45 degree slopes on a 2 x 8 plate, placed by stud index
0 Name: roof-slope-row.ldr
0 Author: ldraw-nova recipe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // plate: 2 x 8 plate; part lists its studs in x, then z order
1 72 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3034.dat
0 STEP
0 // slope-0: Slope covering studs 0-3; the origin offset of the slope is the tool's problem
1 320 -60 -24 10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3039.dat
0 // slope-1: 3039.dat
1 320 -20 -24 10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3039.dat
0 // slope-2: 3039.dat
1 320 20 -24 10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3039.dat
0 // slope-3: 3039.dat
1 320 60 -24 10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3039.dat
0 NOFILE
